    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-chat-step",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "screenshot",
      "label": "09-onb-chat-no-llm"
    },
    {
      "kind": "expect",
      "testid": "onboarding-skip-optional"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "onboarding-skip-optional"
    },
    {
      "kind": "sleep",
      "ms": 800
    },
    {
      "kind": "screenshot",
      "label": "10-onb-skip-optional"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-finish",
      "timeoutMs": 30000
    },
    {
      "kind": "screenshot",
      "label": "11-onb-celebration"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "onboarding-finish",
      "timeoutMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitGone",
      "testid": "onboarding-modal",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "screenshot",
      "label": "12-onb-finished"
    },
    {
      "kind": "goto",
      "route": "settings"
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "settings-page",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "settings-nav-danger",
      "timeoutMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "danger-section",
      "timeoutMs": 6000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-btn",
      "timeoutMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-continue",
      "timeoutMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-input",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "fill",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-input",
      "text": "RESET"
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "reset-onboarding-confirm-confirm",
      "timeoutMs": 4000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-modal",
      "timeoutMs": 30000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-welcome",
      "timeoutMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "onboarding-welcome-cta",
      "timeoutMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-profile-selector",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "profile-card-operator",
      "timeoutMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-ai-setup",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "onboarding-open-cloud",
      "timeoutMs": 10000
    },
    {
      "kind": "click",
      "testid": "onboarding-open-cloud",
      "timeoutMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "kind": "waitFor",
      "testid": "llm-page",
      "timeoutMs": 15000
    },
    {
      "kind": "screenshot",
      "label": "13-onb-open-cloud-lands-on-llm"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "The footer button is step-dependent (OnboardingModal.svelte): every step but the conversation renders onboarding-skip (abandon onboarding), while the conversation renders onboarding-skip-optional, which drops only the remaining optional questions and still routes to the permissions phase. Abandoning there would skip permissions entirely, so the button is deliberately not the same one.",
    "The phase that follows the optional skip depends on the agent answering, which a deterministic run has no model for. The script therefore stops at the click plus a screenshot instead of asserting a downstream phase.",
    "llm-load-model-btn, stt-load-model-btn and the curated rows stay unplayed: the first two open the native file picker, the rows start a network download. onboarding-skip-error-details needs the skip to fail, which the seeded HOME never does."
  ]
}
